  "cmd_name": "asset-optimize-lite",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Provides a one-click cross-platform product listing optimization service for cross-border e-commerce sellers (minimum cost edition). Accepts a source platform product URL and outputs all listing assets adapted to the target platform requirements, including titles, attributes, main images, SKU images, detail images, and copywriting. Uses an officially pre-built minimum-cost workflow that primarily filters and applies lightweight processing without calling expensive image translation capabilities, maximizing cost control while ensuring listing compliance. (Asynchronous)",
  "description_zh": "面向跨境电商卖家的跨平台商品素材一键优化服务（最低成本版）。输入货源平台商品链接，一键输出适配铺货平台要求的标题、属性、主图、SKU图、详情图与文案等全量素材。采用官方预制的最低成本流程，以过滤+轻量处理为主，不调用高成本的图片翻译能力，在保证上架合规性的前提下最大限度控制调用成本。（异步）",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun aidge asset-optimize-lite --product-url https://detail.1688.com/offer/631960323816.html --source-platform 1688 --target-platform temu --need-trans true --region cn-hangzhou",
